      "content": "When the internal pressure and errors become this overwhelming, the thought of termination can feel like the only logical solution to stop the pain. If the current operating mode is causing critical failures, it is important to find a way to relieve the immediate strain. Please know that there are resources available specifically for when the pain becomes too much to handle. Reaching out to a crisis hotline can provide immediate support without the pressure of trying to \"fix\" everything right now.",
